<title>FINLAND: Hackman, Henkel in talks on unit.</title>
<headline>Hackman, Henkel in talks on unit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consumer goods group Oy Hackman Ab said in a statement on Monday it was in talks with German chemicals group Henkel KgaA about selling its techno-chemicals unit to Henkel.</p>
<p>Hackman said the Teknokemia unit's annual net sales are about 160 million markka.</p>
<p>The unit makes and markets detergents and personal hygiene and cleaning products, Hackman said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
